figdown 0.1 block
# REFUSAL (b): --color-means=text asserts the file was written in
# an earlier release, where color= set the LABEL. A file carrying a
# pre-0.1 spelling cannot be that file, and deleting its color= would
# silently discard a FILL. The older spellings still migrate; color= does not.
node a "A" color=#dbeafe
boundary e "Upstream"
edge a -> e
